sequenceDiagram
    participant RUN   as run.py
    participant AGENT as ReAct Agent
    participant LLM   as Gemini 2.5 Flash
    participant IFC   as IFC Backend

    Note over RUN: loads IFC + creates agent

    loop for each case
        RUN->>AGENT: input (chat + photos + metadata)
        activate AGENT

        loop ReAct
            AGENT->>LLM: reason
            LLM-->>AGENT: tool call
            AGENT->>IFC: search / filter / match_image
            IFC-->>AGENT: candidates
        end

        AGENT-->>RUN: EvalTrace (GUIDs + reasoning)
        deactivate AGENT
    end
